# CHECK-NEXT: 243
# CHECK-NEXT: exited with 0
# The row of the operation, then that of the operation of the run time, as each was before: under testing=CheckEffectsAtRunTime (ir/AOTEffectsNet.h) the process stops by name.
# RUN(OPERATION): run-in-shell testing=CheckEffectsAtRunTime,RowSaysLess:Operation/DefineGetter/StringStorage globalThis.id = value => value; globalThis.keep = value => value; globalThis.report = value => print(String(value));
